Entry:

Today we began working with the VL53L1X time-of-flight (ToF) distance sensors. The initial setup involved importing and configuring the necessary libraries to establish communication between the sensors and our microcontroller. We tested basic ranging functionality and verified the sensors' ability to measure distances up to 4 meters with millimeter-level precision. This marks the first step in integrating these high-accuracy sensors into our navigation system.

